WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.422
No new sounds from here on. Today all eight are mixed up.

2
00:00:03.872 --> 00:00:06.452
Watch first. Then do the same with your child.

3
00:00:06.952 --> 00:00:11.377
Point to the sixteen letters in any order you like. Your child says each sound.

4
00:00:12.761 --> 00:00:13.588
As in moon.

5
00:00:17.993 --> 00:00:18.859
As in nest.

6
00:00:21.749 --> 00:00:26.217
If your child says the name of a letter, say: that is its name. What is its sound?

7
00:00:26.667 --> 00:00:31.103
If a sound is gone, use the picture and the action. They are the way back to it.

8
00:00:31.553 --> 00:00:37.566
Then the path of words. Each word is the same as the one before, with one letter changed. Watch.

9
00:00:40.994 --> 00:00:41.957
The word is sat.

10
00:00:45.691 --> 00:00:46.685
The word is sit.

11
00:00:50.444 --> 00:00:51.461
The word is sip.

12
00:00:52.361 --> 00:00:58.058
Read the path together once. Then press play on the sound track for job two, and step away.

13
00:00:58.508 --> 00:01:02.912
Your child reads four words, and draws a line from each one to its picture.
